      "html": "<div class=\"ds-author\"><h2>Built by Rich Crane — Microsoft MVP, MILL5.</h2><p>Part of the <i>Inventing Fire with AI</i> initiative.</p><div class=\"ds-author-links\"><a href=\"https://mill5.com\">MILL5</a><a href=\"https://github.com/ChiefInnovator\">GitHub</a></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-author{padding:44px 40px;background:var(--brand-surface,#120f0c);color:var(--brand-ink,#f2ece3);border:1px solid #514335;border-radius:14px}.ds-author h2{font:500 22px/1.3 Fraunces,\"Iowan Old Style\",Palatino,serif;margin:0 0 6px}.ds-author p{margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--brand-muted,#c9bfb0);font:15px/1.55 Chivo,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif}.ds-author-links{display:flex;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap}.ds-author-links a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;font:12px/1.5 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brand-muted,#c9bfb0);text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid transparent}.ds-author-links a:hover{color:var(--brand-accent,#ffb347);border-bottom-color:var(--brand-accent,#ffb347)}.ds-author-links a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--gold,#f0b13e);outline-offset:4px}@media(max-width:860px){.ds-author{text-align:center;padding:32px 24px}.ds-author-links{justify-content:center}}"
