      "description": "Clipped scroll panel with sticky headers, visible directional cue, and inward keyboard focus. No evaluation scores are invented.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-scorecard\"><p id=\"ds-scorecard-help\" class=\"ds-scorecard-help\">Scroll within the table for more rows; scroll sideways on narrow screens for all columns.</p><div class=\"ds-table\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Referenced skills scorecard\" aria-describedby=\"ds-scorecard-help\" tabindex=\"0\"><table><thead><tr><th>Skill</th><th>Score</th></tr></thead><tbody></tbody></table></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-scorecard{background:var(--panel,#fff);border:1px solid var(--line,#d9dde3);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 16px 42px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}.ds-table{height:min(60vh,36rem);overflow:auto}.ds-table:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--steel,#236477);outline-offset:-3px}.ds-table table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:860px;font:14px/1.5 Chivo,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif}.ds-table th{padding:13px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#d9dde3);text-align:left;vertical-align:top;background:var(--code,#20252b);color:#fff;font-size:12px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.04em}.ds-scorecard-help{margin:0;padding:12px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#d9dde3);color:var(--muted,#5a5f66);font:16px/1.5 Chivo,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif}.ds-table th{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:1}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Terminal code region",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "terminal",
      "description": "Named, keyboard-scrollable code region with gold inward focus on charcoal.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-terminal\"><div class=\"ds-bar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><pre tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Pragmatic Coder quality gate example\"><code><span class=\"ds-key\">pragmatic-coder</span>\n  <span class=\"ds-ok\">✓</span> read code/docs/tests\n  <span class=\"ds-bad\">✕</span> tolerate unsupported claims</code></pre></div>",
      "css": ".ds-terminal{background:var(--code,#20252b);color:#f4f4f4;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 18px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.16)}.ds-bar{height:42px;display:flex;gap:7px;align-items:center;padding:0 14px;background:#15191e}.ds-bar span{width:11px;height:11px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ember,#d94f30)}.ds-bar span:nth-child(2){background:var(--gold,#f0b13e)}.ds-bar span:nth-child(3){background:var(--green,#1d7a5f)}.ds-terminal pre{margin:0;padding:24px;overflow-x:auto;font:15px/1.65 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace}.ds-terminal pre:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--gold,#f0b13e);outline-offset:-3px}.ds-key{color:var(--gold,#f0b13e)}.ds-ok{color:#77d6aa}.ds-bad{color:#ff9a80}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Fire Workshop",
    "overview": "The existing fire identity sits inside practical documentation: cool paper,\nwhite content panels, and charcoal navigation, hero, and code surfaces. Compact\nbranding and direct typography keep the library's content and actions legible.\nThis describes the incumbent implementation rather than a replacement concept.\n\nThe checked-in layered flame and the dark author panel connect the library to\nInventing Fire with AI. Chivo carries the interface; the author byline alone\nuses Fraunces, matching the owner-approved Video Downloader branding reference.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Cool paper and white panels separated by fine neutral borders.",
      "Charcoal anchors with restrained ember, gold, and steel accents.",
      "Chivo hierarchy, readable body leading, and a limited serif author byline.",
      "Compact flame branding, wrapping links, and bordered content cards."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Surface Contrast Rule",
        "body": "Use steel focus outlines on light surfaces and gold outlines on navigation, hero, author, and focused terminal code surfaces, as implemented. ",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The One Byline Rule",
        "body": "Keep Fraunces confined to the author heading; Chivo remains the site's primary family. ",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Bordered Panel Rule",
        "body": "Ordinary content cards retain their neutral border and flat fill; reserve the documented shadows for their existing component roles. ",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do preserve the checked-in flame, its proportions, and compact navigation placement.",
      "Do use Chivo for the interface and reserve Fraunces for the author byline.",
      "Do retain neutral borders, readable text leading, and visible contrasting focus.",
      "Do preserve wrapping actions, native link semantics, and scrollable code or tables.",
      "Do keep brand attribution and package descriptions grounded in repository content."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't enlarge the full wordmark into a separate branding section that displaces the first viewport.",
      "Don't spread the author panel's serif or warm palette across ordinary documentation.",
      "Don't turn informational tags into controls without implementing their semantics and behavior.",
      "Don't use color or terminal indicators as the only way to communicate status.",
      "Don't shrink package-link targets below (44px) in either dimension or move the scorecard focus ring outside its clipped panel."
    ]
  }
}
